.TH AVR\-GROUP 1 "" "avr" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-group \- View the organization's groups.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr group
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
View the organization's groups.
.PP
Each service token belongs to one of these groups. Organization members list them while signed in with `avr auth login`; a scoped or service token cannot.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
list
List the organization's groups by path.
